  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 702.01 Public Water System Requirements under RSA 485:1. Pumps installed as part of a public water system as defined by RSA 485:1-a, XV shall be subject to, Env-Dw 301, Env-Dw 302, Env-Dw 404, Env-Dw 405, and Env-Dw 406, or successor rules, in addition to these rules.\n\nSource. #4198, eff 1-5-87; amd by #4550, eff 1-1-89; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
